// Wave — the back-and-forth is a group in braces, and `q` does it again. The whole is a
// `move`: without a length it lasts as long as it was defined (3 beats); `wave:2` would squeeze it into 2.
title "Wave"
tempo 96
time 4/4

move wave { rightArm { { up:1/2@bent side.high:1/2@bent } q q } }

section Wave {
  rightArm { side.high:1@bent wave | down:2 hold:2 }
  head     { hold:1 fwd.right:1 hold:2 | fwd:2 hold:2 }
}

// The same with the left arm: `leftArm { side.high:1@bent wave@mirror | down:2 hold:2 }`.
